# Audi A8 D3 four-door saloon, 2002-2010.
#
# The D3 A8: 5,062 mm long, 1,894 mm wide, 1,444 mm high, 2,942 mm wheelbase
# (A8 L 5,181/3,074); aluminium space frame, 3.0-6.0 petrol and 3.0/4.2 diesel,
# quattro standard on most. Facelift in 2005.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A8
#
# Colours: Phantom Black, Quartz Silver, Night Blue and Dolphin Grey are period
# Audi finishes.
#
# Weight: 30 in total (black 12, silver 8, blue 5, grey 5).
#
# Speed 250 km/h; comfort 150/555 (line). Classes 3,4.
# Dates: 2002-2010 with a road tail to about 2022.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a8-d3.blend. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a8-d3/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.
#
# Gate C, 2026-11-16: accepted as built. Known deviation: the body is an angular
# low-poly approximation; the tail lamps are rectangular blocks rather than the
# wrap-around units in the photographs, and the C-pillar is heavy. Silhouette,
# glass band (29% of height) and proportions match. No correction round.

obj=citycar
